<% content_for :title, page_title("About") %>

<article class="article">
  <div class="article__inner">
    <%= link_to "← Back to notes", root_path, class: "article__back" %>

    <h1>About me</h1>

    <div class="article__body">
      <p>Hey, I'm gURL.</p>

      <p>
        I'm a software engineer. I started this site to write things down
        while I'm still figuring them out — not after I've got it all sorted.
      </p>

      <p>
        Mostly this is for me. But if you're here too, welcome. You'll find
        notes on code, productivity, career, and self-improvement — sometimes
        all in the same week. That's kind of the point.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
